  "body": "**Blocked by:** none\n\n## Context\n\nReview follow-up from harvest issue #889. PR #533 (finding e19987d618), `backend/packages/data/src/__tests__/publicSurface.test.ts:541`: `pool` is assigned inside the second `it()` callback rather than in `beforeAll`. It works only while that test is not filtered out; with `.skip` or `--testNamePattern` the pool is never initialised, and the `afterAll` `pool?.end()` silently does nothing.\n\n## Task\n\nAssign `pool = getTestPool()` in a `beforeAll` of the `@semprec/data public surface` describe block and remove the assignment from the `it()` callback. Change nothing else.\n\n## Touches\n\n- backend/packages/data/src/__tests__/publicSurface.test.ts (the pool setup only)\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\nThe setup move.\n\n### Out of scope\n\nThe expected-name lists and the other assertions.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- `pool` is assigned in `beforeAll`, not inside an `it()` callback.\n- Both tests in the file pass, including when run alone with `--testNamePattern`, and `pnpm run verify` in `backend/` passes.\n\n\n<!-- crb-followup:v1 pr=533 key=e19987d618 -->",
